    {
      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "בעצם היום הזה",
      "rationale": "Gĩkũyũ kĩigana mũru (bona) ũrĩa Kĩhibirania kĩrĩ nĩ 'mũru wa mũthenya ũyũ' — 'mũthenya ũyũ mwene mwĩrĩ' nĩgeetha kĩhubirania kĩoneke."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "כפרים \/ לכפר",
      "rationale": "Kĩhibirania kĩruta kĩugo kĩmwe gĩa kũharithia matu-inĩ marĩa — kĩharo-nĩingĩ na kũharingĩrwo — gĩkuumithania kwa kĩugo gĩtihotekagia gĩthũngũ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "wanyu",
      "rationale": "אלהיכה nĩ Erohimu hamwe na kamũheanio gĩa kũaria ũrĩa wonekire; -kũm gĩathiagĩrĩra mũgambo wa Kĩhibirania, nĩgeetha 'wanyu' nĩonyanĩririo."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na mũgũnda ũciothe wa ciira mũtarĩkũgĩa thĩinĩ wa mũru wa mũthenya ũyũ; nĩgũkorwo nĩ mũthenya wa kĩharo-nĩingĩ, wo kũharingĩrwo nthĩinĩ yanyu mbere ya Yahwe Erohimu wanyu.",
